---
/**
 * FinalCTA - Chamada final para ação com gradiente animado
 */
---

<section class="py-60 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <div
            class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full max-w-2xl aspect-square bg-linear-to-r from-purple-600 to-blue-600 rounded-full blur-[180px] opacity-10 animate-pulse"
        >
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2
            class="text-7xl md:text-[10rem] font-black mb-16 leading-[0.8] italic uppercase tracking-tighter"
        >
            SEM BOLETOS.<br /><span
                class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-linear-to-b from-white to-zinc-800 underline decoration-purple-500/50"
                >SÓ RESULTADOS.</span
            >
        </h2>
        <p
            class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-zinc-400 mb-20 max-w-2xl mx-auto italic font-medium"
        >
            Você tem a ideia. Nós damos o kit. A I.A. faz o trabalho.
        </p>
        <a
            href="/templates"
            class="inline-block px-16 py-8 bg-white text-black font-black text-2xl rounded-full hover:scale-110 hover:shadow-[0_20px_80px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] transition-all active:scale-95"
        >
            LIBERAR MEU ACESSO GRÁTIS
        </a>
    </div>
</section>
